<title>USA: IHOP Corp Oct same store sales up 1.7 pct.</title>
<headline>IHOP Corp Oct same store sales up 1.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>GLENDALE, Calif. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>IHOP Corp said on Thursday that same store sales for the fiscal month of October were up 1.7 percent, compared to an increase of 0.2 percent in the same period last year.</p>
<p>Further details were not available.</p>
<p>IHOP develops, franchises and operates International House of Pancakes restaurants.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
